{"id": 63395, "date": "2025-12-22T04:00:06", "date_gmt": "2025-12-22T12:00:06", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63395"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T21:23:37", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T04:23:37", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-22-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/22/kingdom-of-days-december-22-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 22"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>1966:\u00a0</strong>The Castiles play a gig at the Hullaballoo in Middletown, New Jersey.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"31891\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/hulla/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/hulla.jpg?fit=620%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"620,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"hulla\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/hulla.jpg?fit=620%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-31891 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/hulla.jpg?resize=620%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/hulla.jpg?w=620&amp;ssl=1 620w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/hulla.jpg?resize=233%2C300&amp;ssl=1 233w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1967:\u00a0</strong>The Castiles open for The Broadways at the Ocean Side Surf Club in Sea Bright, New Jersey.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6744\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1967-1222/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1222.jpg?fit=225%2C275&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"225,275\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1967-1222\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1222.jpg?fit=225%2C275&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6744 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1222.jpg?resize=225%2C275&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"275\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1971:\u00a0</strong>Bruce is in California visiting his parents, with no set return date. It appears that he anticipates staying a while, though, because he takes the time to obtain his California driver&#8217;s license.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6030\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/cadriverlice/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/cadriverlice-e1540747774272.jpg?fit=640%2C452&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"640,452\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"cadriverlice\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/cadriverlice-e1540747774272.jpg?fit=758%2C535&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6030 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/cadriverlice-e1540747774272.jpg?resize=640%2C452&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"452\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/cadriverlice-e1540747774272.jpg?w=640&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/cadriverlice-e1540747774272.jpg?resize=300%2C212&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1973:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and his band headline at Uncle Al&#8217;s Erlton Theater Lounge in Cherry Hill, New Jersey.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6745\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1973-1222/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1222.jpeg?fit=645%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"645,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1973-1222\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1222.jpeg?fit=645%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6745 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1222.jpeg?resize=645%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"645\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1222.jpeg?w=645&amp;ssl=1 645w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1222.jpeg?resize=242%2C300&amp;ssl=1 242w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 645px) 100vw, 645px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1977:\u00a0</strong>Bruce calls into WHFS-FM in Bethesda to record a Christmas message for his fans and the station&#8217;s listeners.</p>\n<div id=\"v-WyvLEBBw-1\" class=\"video-player\"><div id='v-WyvLEBBw'></div></div>\n<p><strong>1984:\u00a0</strong>As &#8220;Born in the U.S.A.&#8221; moves up the charts,\u00a0<em>American Top 40</em> host Casey Kasem lauds Bruce&#8217;s work ethic.</p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-63395-2\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/AT40-1984-12-22.mp3?_=2\" /><a href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/AT40-1984-12-22.mp3\">https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/AT40-1984-12-22.mp3</a></audio>\n<p><strong>2002:\u00a0</strong>Bruce holds a private holiday party and performance at The Stone Pony in Asbury Park.</p>\n<p><strong>2008:\u00a0</strong>Bruce makes a surprise appearance at Bobby Bandiera&#8217;s Hope Concert at the Count Basie Theater in Red Bank, performing a few numbers with Jon Bon Jovi, Southside Johnny, Gary U.S. Bonds, and others.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EaxAA4kG5r8?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showin